Example code licenses
=====================

Adapted official OpenMV examples retain their individual copyright notices
and MIT license. See LICENSE.openmv-MIT.txt.

New project examples marked SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 use the
Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE.Apache-2.0.txt.

These code licenses do not relicense model weights, Haar cascades, images,
or other data. Retain the asset provenance and notices in each assets/
directory and ../models/licenses/. ../models/MODEL_MANIFEST.json identifies
model sources, hashes and model-specific license records. Large model weights are not
included in this example catalog; obtain them from the project's models/.
